---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AppStoreLink from '../components/AppStoreLink.astro';
---

<Base>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Your things, privately kept.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Hutch is an iPhone app for keeping track of everything you own. It’s end-to-end encrypted,
      so no one sees your inventory but you. Not even us.
    </p>
    <AppStoreLink />
  </section>

  <ul class="shelves">
    <li>
      <h2>Behind closed doors</h2>
      <p>Everything you add starts private. Snap it, name it, and know what you have and where it is.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2>A few things on the shelf<span class="soon">Later</span></h2>
      <p>When you choose, open a small door for the neighbors you trust: the ladder, the folding table, the tent.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2>Out the door<span class="soon">Later</span></h2>
      <p>Sell what you no longer need, straight from your inventory, when it’s time.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <section class="callout">
    <h2>What we can’t see</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your items, photos, notes and where things are kept are encrypted on your iPhone.</li>
      <li>The keys never leave your device. We only ever hold data we can’t read.</li>
      <li>No ads, no analytics, no trackers. On this site either.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
